body: "The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n\n- Failing job: `release`\n- Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/actions/runs/40297119835\n- Commit: 244c3c2f0d2821dda2ad3fda569b9bc993962333\n- Date (UTC): 2026-10-26T10:10:26Z\n\n\n---\n\n### GitHub comments (1)\n\n> **@unbraind** (2026-10-26T14:42:41Z)\n>\n> Recovered: pm-csv@2026.10.26 is published on npm (`npm view pm-csv version` → 2026.10.26); successful release run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/actions/runs/40308216151. The earlier failure was the release PR's required checks still queued after the job's 30-minute merge wait (runner pool saturated); the host release-rerun sweep re-ran it."
